BT /F1 11 Tf 72 760 Td (Page 45) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 746 Td (1 Q. Do you see the email of 19 September 2023?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 732 Td (2 A. Yes. Ravensworth said the dashboard was wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 718 Td (3 Q. Was it fit for purpose?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 704 Td (4 A. The September dashboard was not fit for purpose. I accept that.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 690 Td (5 Q. What was wrong with it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 676 Td (6 A. The stock figures were not refreshing. The team fixed it by 2 October 2023.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (7 Q. Did you tell Ravensworth that?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 648 Td (8 A. I told them on 2 October that the fix was live.) Tj ET
