stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 760 Td (Page 46) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 746 Td (1 Q. When did Ravensworth terminate the agreement?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 732 Td (2 A. By notice dated 6 November 2023. I saw it on 7 November.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 718 Td (3 Q. Did Kestrel accept the termination?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 704 Td (4 A. No. We treated it as wrongful. The agreement had no right to terminate for that.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 690 Td (5 Q. Did Kestrel stop work?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 676 Td (6 A. Yes, on 7 November 2023. We stopped the following morning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (7 Q. Did Kestrel offer to continue?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 648 Td (8 A. I do not recall an offer to continue.) Tj ET
